## Integration acceptance

- On a player that supports them, check pause, mute and stop one at a time. On a restricted player, check that the unsupported actions are absent.
- Check the keyboard limits of volume and seek, and the output and source names, at 320px and with enlarged text.
- Confirm that navigation, theme changes and loading an example send no media command.

Record the actual environment, versions, state, method and result using [Native task accessibility and evidence](native-task-accessibility.html). A source review or a local example does not show physical behaviour, screen-reader use or live compatibility.
